{"results":[{"url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Da091hvM7OZ/","final_url":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/Da091hvM7OZ/","title":"Vinay Sharma on Instagram: \"Stand-up comedian Kunal Kamra has once again found himself at the center of controversy after a video circulating on social media allegedly showed him making an objectionable remark about Lord Ram. The clip has triggered strong reactions online, with many users expressing anger and demanding accountability.\n\nThe controversy intensified after another viral video purportedly showed a group of CJP protesters laughing during demonstrations linked to the issue. The visuals have fueled debate across social media, with critics questioning the protesters’ conduct and supporters arguing that the clips lack full context.\n\nAs the videos continue to circulate, the incident has sparked widespread discussion on freedom of expression, religious sentiments, and political protests. Several social media users have called for a thorough review of the viral footage before drawing conclusions.\n\nAt the time of writing, the authenticity and full context of the viral videos have not been independently verified, and there has been no official statement from Kunal Kamra or the CJP addressing the specific clips. The controversy continues to generate intense reactions online.\n\n#cjp #explore\"","description":"570 likes, 58 comments - vinayshaarma on July 15, 2026: \"Stand-up comedian Kunal Kamra has once again found himself at the center of controversy after a video circulating on social media allegedly showed him making an objectionable remark about Lord Ram. The clip has triggered strong reactions online, with many users expressing anger and demanding accountability.\n\nThe controversy intensified after another viral video purportedly showed a group of CJP protesters laughing during demonstrations linked to the issue. The visuals have fueled debate across social media, with critics questioning the protesters’ conduct and supporters arguing that the clips lack full context.\n\nAs the videos continue to circulate, the incident has sparked widespread discussion on freedom of expression, religious sentiments, and political protests. Several social media users have called for a thorough review of the viral footage before drawing conclusions.\n\nAt the time of writing, the authenticity and full context of the viral videos have not been independently verified, and there has been no official statement from Kunal Kamra or the CJP addressing the specific clips. The controversy continues to generate intense reactions online.\n\n#cjp #explore\". ","language":"en","text":"Sorry, we're having trouble playing this video.\n\nStand-up comedian Kunal Kamra has once again found himself at the center of controversy after a video circulating on social media allegedly showed him making an objectionable remark about Lord Ram. The clip has triggered strong reactions online, with many users expressing anger and demanding accountability.  \n  \nThe controversy intensified after another viral video purportedly showed a group of CJP protesters laughing during demonstrations linked to the issue. The visuals have fueled debate across social media, with critics questioning the protesters’ conduct and supporters arguing that the clips lack full context.  \n  \nAs the videos continue to circulate, the incident has sparked widespread discussion on freedom of expression, religious sentiments, and political protests. Several social media users have called for a thorough review of the viral footage before drawing conclusions.  \n  \nAt the time of writing, the authenticity and full context of the viral videos have not been independently verified, and there has been no official statement from Kunal Kamra or the CJP addressing the specific clips. The controversy continues to generate intense reactions online.  \n  \n#cjp #explore\n\nThe controversy intensified after another viral video purportedly showed a group of CJP protesters laughing during demonstrations linked to the issue. The visuals have fueled debate across social media, with critics questioning the protesters’ conduct and supporters arguing that the clips lack full context.\n\nAs the videos continue to circulate, the incident has sparked widespread discussion on freedom of expression, religious sentiments, and political protests. Several social media users have called for a thorough review of the viral footage before drawing conclusions.\n\nAt the time of writing, the authenticity and full context of the viral videos have not been independently verified, and there has been no official statement from Kunal Kamra or the CJP addressing the specific clips. The controversy continues to generate intense reactions online.\n\n#cjp #explore\n\nBhai shabdo ko achhe se use krna chahiye.\n\nReply\n\nसबसे बड़ा हिंजड़ा तो वो है जो सुनने के बाद ताली बजा रहा है।\n\nReply\n\nTeri maa ka bharosa Teri maa ka name le madar ke\n\nReply\n\nजल्दी बदला लिया जाएगा। तेरा\n\nReply\n\nJio sarkar ko sita mata Ka bura nhi Nita ke pati ka bura laga h\n\nReply\n\nSita ka pati Ram nhi h kya ? Isme mirchi kiu lg rhi h logo ko ? 😂\n\nReply\n\nThis is wrong There was no need to bring Sita Mata into this Also the tone of this video is a very disrespectful 😡😡 @delhi.police\\_official\n\nReply\n\nAmbani should file FIR against him immediately & all hindu also... @aambani1\n\nReply\n\nReason for not supporting these kind of protest 👏 need strict action 🙌 @delhi.police\\_official @officialrekhagupta\n\nReply\n\nFame nahi mil rha. ... Soch rha hai bakchodi krunga haha hoga 😂\n\nReply\n\nGanjhe - pakistan ja fir bol .. agli subha nahi utega\n\nReply\n\nLog in to like or comment.","author":null,"published_date":"2026-07-15T20:51:58.000Z","latency_ms":7942.58605199866,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}